## Dataset Source

The project uses live data retrieved from online news sources through RSS feeds. The data is collected directly from the following sources:

* The New York Times
* BBC News
* The Guardian

The system retrieves the latest available articles from these RSS feeds during each execution. The collected data includes the article title, summary, and source name. The data is then processed for cleaning, sentiment analysis, keyword analysis, and visualization.

Since the data is retrieved dynamically, the dataset may change each time the project is executed depending on the latest articles available from the sources.
